WEBVTT

01:09.340 --> 01:13.840
Mob 2
~Rival~

01:14.430 --> 01:16.360
Wait, was there an accident?

01:17.150 --> 01:18.410
What the heck?

01:18.410 --> 01:18.948
- He's bleeding.

01:18.950 --> 01:20.620
- Whoa, this is bad.
- He's bleeding.

01:23.400 --> 01:26.510
Oh, God...

01:27.670 --> 01:27.938
- Uh, I need to...

01:27.940 --> 01:29.060
Seriously?
- Uh, I need to...

01:29.060 --> 01:30.110
- This looks bad.
- Uh, I need to...

01:30.110 --> 01:31.268
- A middle schooler? No way...
- Call...

01:31.270 --> 01:32.540
- That was insanely loud.
- C-Call an a-ambulance...

01:32.541 --> 01:34.541
- C-Call an a-ambulance...

01:35.140 --> 01:37.150
What street is this?

01:37.150 --> 01:38.620
He's not moving...

01:39.000 --> 01:42.090
B-Bro...

01:46.590 --> 01:49.780
Wh-What the? My phone...

01:50.900 --> 01:53.820
H-Hey, bro?

02:06.418 --> 02:08.128
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:09.248 --> 02:10.998
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:12.168 --> 02:13.838
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:15.008 --> 02:16.678
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:18.088 --> 02:20.808
I realized that our youth is gray

02:20.808 --> 02:23.728
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

02:23.808 --> 02:26.228
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

02:26.228 --> 02:29.398
Struggling through this adolescence

02:29.518 --> 02:32.358
Don't disturb my deep psyche

02:32.358 --> 02:35.028
Who is that behind you?

02:35.148 --> 02:38.818
Opposing ideas creates distortion

02:38.818 --> 02:42.238
Exorcise all the sorrow

02:42.408 --> 02:45.908
So, do what you can now

02:45.998 --> 02:47.828
My life

02:48.078 --> 02:51.958
Finally, break it down

02:53.458 --> 02:56.298
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

02:56.298 --> 02:59.178
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

02:59.178 --> 03:01.928
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

03:01.928 --> 03:04.888
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

03:04.888 --> 03:07.388
Taking things as it is

03:07.388 --> 03:10.808
In this free relation where
We resent each other

03:10.898 --> 03:13.108
Once these two become one

03:13.108 --> 03:15.108
That smile becomes one

03:15.108 --> 03:18.198
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:18.858 --> 03:21.868
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:22.198 --> 03:23.278
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:23.278 --> 03:26.158
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:26.328 --> 03:27.868
"1"

03:27.868 --> 03:29.038
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:29.038 --> 03:31.328
One and only "1"

03:36.180 --> 03:39.310
Come on, Ly-chan. Hurry.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.990
Okay.

03:55.590 --> 03:58.660
Why the hell is there traffic here?

03:58.660 --> 04:01.250
Hey, we're gonna be late.

04:01.250 --> 04:02.110
I know...

04:02.850 --> 04:04.090
Wh-What the?

04:04.090 --> 04:05.450
An earthquake?

04:05.450 --> 04:06.860
I don't know!

04:06.860 --> 04:07.860
What's happening?

04:08.200 --> 04:11.420
Hey, my phone's not working.

04:13.010 --> 04:15.670
Hey, what the hell is this?!

04:24.230 --> 04:25.440
What's going on?!

04:25.720 --> 04:26.630
An earthquake?!

04:26.630 --> 04:27.200
An explosion?!

04:27.200 --> 04:28.170
What the hell?

04:32.070 --> 04:36.443
Everyone in the area should follow
evacuation orders immediately.

04:36.443 --> 04:38.870
Man, this earthquake sucks.

04:39.140 --> 04:40.260
And it's long, too.

04:40.260 --> 04:44.230
This says there are accidents and
crashes happening everywhere.

04:44.230 --> 04:48.470
The cause is unknown. Most of the
major roads in Seasoning City...

04:48.470 --> 04:52.100
are apparently backed up
due to restricted access.

04:52.810 --> 04:55.810
Oh, looks like an evacuation
order's been issued.

04:56.130 --> 04:59.490
Aw, but Shigeo was
gonna ask that girl out.

04:59.490 --> 05:01.730
Yeah, that's not happening today.

05:09.400 --> 05:12.990
Th-The suspect is around
160 centimeters tall...

05:13.350 --> 05:17.900
Um... and wearing a school uniform
and h-holding a bouquet...

05:17.900 --> 05:24.530
H-He's advancing... as he
destroys buildings around him...

05:25.430 --> 05:27.520
Wh-Why...?

05:28.570 --> 05:31.290
C-Come in!

06:12.510 --> 06:14.510
Thank goodness I made it in time.

06:23.070 --> 06:28.620
I had a hunch you'd be here,
so I flew over at the speed of light.

06:28.620 --> 06:30.120
Pretty cool, huh?

06:32.570 --> 06:35.490
So you're destroying everything you touch.

06:36.870 --> 06:38.960
I'm not sure what happened,

06:38.960 --> 06:40.830
but if I'd suffice, I'd be happy to lis...

06:41.530 --> 06:43.180
Wait, seriously?!

06:53.090 --> 06:54.910
Come on. Calm down.

06:54.910 --> 06:57.890
Well? I've gotten stronger, too,
haven't I?

06:58.660 --> 07:02.360
I thought I'd try a bit harder
after observing you.

07:02.780 --> 07:07.010
Oh, you bought flowers! That's great!

07:07.660 --> 07:10.970
But it might be a little dangerous
going as you are right now.

07:55.840 --> 07:58.030
I'm not getting through to him?

07:59.650 --> 08:01.110
You leave me no choice.

08:02.100 --> 08:03.540
I'm gonna have to restrain you!

08:06.990 --> 08:08.450
Sorry!

08:14.120 --> 08:17.650
I'm gonna have to keep you restrained
until your powers calm...

08:29.550 --> 08:30.690
Crap!

08:31.180 --> 08:33.190
Ultimate Barrier!

08:47.820 --> 08:50.490
The way you are right now...

08:51.180 --> 08:53.170
reminds me of when we first met.

08:57.940 --> 08:59.220
Kageyama...

09:02.610 --> 09:05.950
Stop this.
You should head home for the day.

09:07.540 --> 09:09.100
It's for your own good.

09:22.920 --> 09:27.610
Kageyama taught me
something very important...

09:36.670 --> 09:42.100
How I was the one who was average
for relying on these powers.

09:43.110 --> 09:46.750
How important it is to accept yourself
without any psychic powers.

09:47.480 --> 09:52.210
I can tell... that Kageyama
is trying to do just that.

09:53.800 --> 09:55.500
Kageyama...

10:00.540 --> 10:03.990
...isn't the kind of person
who'd hurt others!

10:26.870 --> 10:28.070
He reacted!

10:28.470 --> 10:30.000
If I destroy those...

10:41.750 --> 10:43.860
Say, Kageyama...

10:46.680 --> 10:51.410
You're not supposed to use your psychic
powers against others, right?

11:14.530 --> 11:16.500
Something just came flying!

11:21.200 --> 11:23.450
Hey, what the hell was that sound?!

11:39.090 --> 11:39.758
Mommy!

11:39.760 --> 11:41.200
Who the hell is this guy?!

11:41.200 --> 11:43.420
He's destroying things as he walks?

11:43.620 --> 11:45.980
Get away! He's dangerous!

11:45.980 --> 11:47.410
Another earthquake!

11:52.560 --> 11:53.498
I'm scared!

11:53.500 --> 11:56.680
Not here, Kageyama!

11:57.850 --> 12:00.380
There are people
who haven't evacuated yet!

12:01.210 --> 12:02.258
- Kageyama's powers just keep growing...

12:02.260 --> 12:03.270
- That's no human!
- Kageyama's powers just keep growing...

12:03.270 --> 12:05.178
- I'm scared!
- Kageyama's powers just keep growing...

12:05.180 --> 12:07.630
What can I do?

12:09.370 --> 12:13.700
Everyone! It's dangerous here!
Please get to shelter immediately!

12:13.700 --> 12:16.500
This is the epicenter of the disaster!

12:16.500 --> 12:18.170
Please just get as far as you can!

12:19.620 --> 12:20.700
Ly-chan!

12:31.790 --> 12:35.880
Kageyama, are you
having some kind of episode?

12:36.520 --> 12:38.550
To think you, of all people,
would go berserk

12:38.550 --> 12:40.340
and lose control of your powers...

12:42.780 --> 12:46.990
I guess you're pretty average, too!
I'm a bit relieved, honestly.

12:52.380 --> 12:53.460
No...

12:53.720 --> 12:55.280
Wait! There are still people here!

13:03.300 --> 13:04.720
Help!

13:05.190 --> 13:06.348
Daddy!

13:06.350 --> 13:07.830
Mommy!

13:07.830 --> 13:09.208
I don't want to die!

13:09.210 --> 13:11.030
Someone help!

13:11.030 --> 13:12.520
Look out!

13:13.350 --> 13:14.900
What's going on?!

13:14.900 --> 13:16.440
Save me!

13:16.440 --> 13:19.370
Mommy! Help me!

13:20.590 --> 13:22.650
Someone help!

13:39.060 --> 13:40.890
I know this for sure...

13:47.540 --> 13:49.800
I've been watching this whole time...

13:53.260 --> 13:55.980
You're an absolutely gullible softy...

13:56.970 --> 13:59.250
But you're still really strong...

14:00.050 --> 14:02.030
And yet, you...

14:06.050 --> 14:07.830
Back then...

14:08.860 --> 14:11.020
When we first met...

14:13.560 --> 14:15.760
You were crying by yourself.

14:23.640 --> 14:26.340
I'm sure that's the case even now.

14:27.690 --> 14:30.950
You're crying, aren't you, Kageyama?

14:33.210 --> 14:34.360
Well?!

14:37.190 --> 14:40.030
You want someone to stop you!

14:44.070 --> 14:45.610
Don't you?!

14:56.180 --> 14:57.790
Kageyama!

14:58.780 --> 15:00.600
Kageyama!

15:01.320 --> 15:03.440
Kageyama!

15:09.990 --> 15:11.170
What...?

15:11.960 --> 15:14.380
What's going on with me?

15:18.810 --> 15:20.460
Hanazawa!

15:22.200 --> 15:25.890
I can tell... that I did this.

15:27.280 --> 15:29.500
I'm the one who did this...

15:30.890 --> 15:32.790
to Hanazawa, too...

15:35.210 --> 15:39.440
He tried everything he could to stop me
until he ended up like this?

15:44.500 --> 15:46.630
There are times when things
don't work out...

15:49.600 --> 15:51.580
It's fine if people laugh at you.

15:52.420 --> 15:55.030
I'm average, too.

15:55.800 --> 15:58.640
That's enough, Hanazawa-kun...

15:59.930 --> 16:02.910
You don't have to think of this as me.

16:04.300 --> 16:06.840
I can't stop this thing either.

16:07.580 --> 16:09.830
You can fight back!

16:10.380 --> 16:13.790
Yes! Use your powers against me!

16:13.790 --> 16:15.780
But don't underestimate me!

16:16.910 --> 16:18.040
I'm...

16:21.350 --> 16:22.520
I'm...

16:27.830 --> 16:29.790
I'm your...

16:42.860 --> 16:44.530
I'm your rival!

16:50.910 --> 16:53.610
I guess I win this time!

17:33.890 --> 17:37.640
Seriously, how many times
do I have to tell you?

17:37.640 --> 17:39.240
Get a clue already, Koyama.

17:39.540 --> 17:43.130
The items closer to expiry date
go front and center.

17:43.130 --> 17:45.200
Is it that hard to understand?

17:45.200 --> 17:46.840
If you don't, the old bentos...

17:46.840 --> 17:48.170
All right, jeez!

17:48.530 --> 17:54.180
I'm just trying to get our customers
the best products possible.

17:54.180 --> 17:58.460
Have you ever witnessed the moment
a chicken pasta salad on display 3 hours ago

17:58.460 --> 18:00.920
gets thrown in the trash?

18:01.490 --> 18:04.080
Nothing in this world is darker than that.

18:07.950 --> 18:13.270
Well, I can't sell old rice balls
to a customer with a smile.

18:13.270 --> 18:16.720
Now, listen here. You need to
do as you're told sometimes.

18:17.110 --> 18:19.870
Did you forget who recommended
you to the manager?

18:21.590 --> 18:23.620
I'm grateful for what the
manager has done for me.

18:24.150 --> 18:26.050
And that's exactly
why I'm gonna protect...

18:26.750 --> 18:28.990
our store.

18:29.350 --> 18:32.680
As I figured, all this destruction
was caused by an esper.

18:33.270 --> 18:36.050
And he's headed right for
our convenience store.

18:37.660 --> 18:40.640
Hey... That's that one shitty little brat!

18:40.910 --> 18:42.090
What?!

18:42.090 --> 18:44.560
I see... it all makes sense now.

18:45.940 --> 18:48.930
Hey, you little brat! I have
no idea what's going on,

18:48.930 --> 18:51.530
but I ain't gonna hold back
if you're coming for us!

18:53.420 --> 18:55.450
Tch. He's not stopping.

18:55.450 --> 18:57.560
Very well. Then we're going to have to act.

19:02.150 --> 19:04.410
Telekinetic Helix!

19:07.650 --> 19:10.210
Jugan: Oden Tongs!

19:14.480 --> 19:16.740
After the incident
at Seasoning Apartments,

19:16.740 --> 19:17.318
- many other buildings continue to crumble,

19:17.320 --> 19:19.210
- That's not good...
- many other buildings continue to crumble,

19:19.670 --> 19:22.350
I should've asked him
for his phone number.

19:24.840 --> 19:27.340
Mob is going to show up, right?

19:30.860 --> 19:32.730
Hey, look at this.

19:33.100 --> 19:36.270
This is a picture of the incident
location posted online...

19:37.570 --> 19:39.160
That's...

19:40.780 --> 19:43.030
Could that be Lord Psycho Helmet?

19:43.030 --> 19:44.030
It must be!

19:44.030 --> 19:45.230
Wait, but why?

19:45.520 --> 19:48.710
Captain! Isn't the guy in this picture...

19:53.620 --> 19:55.380
It really isn't dying down.

19:56.090 --> 19:58.690
I guess we better comply with
the evacuation orders, too.

19:59.060 --> 20:00.500
What about Shigeo?

20:00.500 --> 20:01.300
Whoa, there.

20:02.630 --> 20:06.260
I can't get through to him.
I think his phone is off.

20:06.260 --> 20:08.030
But we really don't need
to worry about Mob...

20:11.800 --> 20:12.850
What's wrong?

20:13.220 --> 20:15.680
R-Reigen! Look!

20:22.780 --> 20:23.830
Mob?

20:27.790 --> 20:31.450
Apparently, they've managed to evacuate
everyone including the elderly and children.

20:31.450 --> 20:34.040
We can use as much of our
powers as we'd like.

20:34.250 --> 20:36.940
Electronics aren't working in the area,

20:36.940 --> 20:39.760
and the controls for vehicles, such as
cars and helicopters, stopped working.

20:40.220 --> 20:43.350
So you'll be going down with parachutes.

20:44.040 --> 20:45.900
If you're able to help with the situation,

20:45.900 --> 20:48.250
they'll consider reducing your sentences,

20:48.250 --> 20:50.150
so go do your best out there.

20:50.150 --> 20:52.990
Don't forget that you're being
monitored at all times.

20:52.990 --> 20:55.780
We're talking about one
measly esper kid, right?

20:55.780 --> 20:58.930
We've got six. This'll be easy.

20:58.930 --> 21:01.980
That's just based on eyewitness accounts.

21:01.980 --> 21:03.200
Yeah, whatever.

21:03.200 --> 21:06.860
You newbies are gonna
have to listen to us.

21:06.860 --> 21:09.000
Just so you know, we get all the loot...

21:10.170 --> 21:14.110
I'll go by myself.
The target can't be taken lightly.

21:14.580 --> 21:15.570
You bastard!

21:15.570 --> 21:17.150
- Kill! Kill! Kill!
- What the hell'd you do?!

21:18.010 --> 21:21.750
Is the target someone you know?

21:22.310 --> 21:23.750
I can feel his power...

21:25.290 --> 21:27.420
growing even stronger.

21:27.690 --> 21:28.990
Aw, jeez.

21:29.530 --> 21:32.760
We should hurry. Open the back.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.890
Be careful out there, Boss.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.430
Hatori.

21:43.230 --> 21:44.940
Hey, where's your parachute?

21:55.370 --> 22:00.210
The blue light shined
Dazzling my eye at 01:30 AM

22:00.250 --> 22:05.590
Even as I swiped the page over,
The smiles of friends besides me remain

22:15.600 --> 22:18.020
Yes, I want someone to understand

22:18.020 --> 22:20.520
All the colorless and transparent wishes

22:20.520 --> 22:23.020
All the breath stuck within
The depth of my heart

22:23.020 --> 22:25.650
Suddenly flowed out
Bringing my consciousness back

22:25.650 --> 22:28.110
I remember the days hung dry

22:28.110 --> 22:30.620
The very normal days passed by

22:30.620 --> 22:33.080
Even if reality is corrupted

22:33.080 --> 22:35.830
The sky we saw together
Was definitely real

22:36.410 --> 22:40.540
It's harder to understand than
The grammar on the blackboard

22:40.540 --> 22:45.760
The story that disappears
Under 24 hours makes me sad and lonely

22:46.010 --> 22:50.220
It's so hard, and I find myself
On the verge of giving up again and again

22:50.220 --> 22:51.760
But I...

22:52.600 --> 22:55.930
The current me will no longer give up

22:56.060 --> 23:00.940
Overflowing emotions on my sleeve,
Running through worry and doubt

23:00.940 --> 23:03.573
Nobody has decided
if the future is 0 or 100,

23:03.575 --> 23:06.150
So I'll paint over them myself

23:06.150 --> 23:08.541
Even if my existence itself
can't be proven,

23:08.543 --> 23:11.571
If this world struck me in my heart

23:11.700 --> 23:14.240
I will flood it with cobalt blue

23:25.760 --> 23:28.970
Brother, I haven't seen you
in that state for a while.

23:29.380 --> 23:33.710
I'd always been afraid that this thing
would emerge from you again.

23:34.350 --> 23:37.860
Next time onMob Psycho 100 III Episode 11:

23:37.860 --> 23:39.660
"Mob 3 ~Trauma~."
